# Committed golden cross-version fixtures.
#
# The repository-root .gitignore excludes `*.tine`, which matches both the
# artifact files (artifact.tine, fork.tine, ...) and the v3 repository's
# internal `.tine` directory. These fixtures are the backwards-compatibility
# release gate and MUST be tracked, so re-include them here (a deeper .gitignore
# overrides the root pattern).
!*.tine
!.tine/
